    Bug 1936502 - Adjust text and icon alignment in account hub notification. r=sol,aleca


    This patch cleans up some of the CSS and fixes the following issues:
    - The notification bar should not increase the width of the account hub dialog
    - The success and warning notifications should stay inside the notification bar
    - When there is more information in a notification, the notification title should be left aligned with the error description

    **How To Test**
    - To test the notification description alignment, go to email.mjs and after line 604, add an additional line `description: "success"`

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D234626

